{"pageid":3777,"title":"Classic Biome","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Classic Biome</span>","revid":19590,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Classic Biome</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8c/ClassicBiome.png/revision/latest?cb=20250117001705\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"ClassicBiome\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8c/ClassicBiome.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250117001705\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8c/ClassicBiome.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250117001705 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8c/ClassicBiome.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250117001705 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"ClassicBiome\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"ClassicBiome.png\" data-image-name=\"ClassicBiome.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">To chop classic wood, rocks, and cacti, as well as to access the Classic Shop</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Music\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Music</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DuH0pN7Ws20\">Kevin MacLeod - Desert City</a> (Desert, old)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Classic Biome</b>, also known as the <b>Classic Island</b>, is a remote area accessed via a the shoreline of <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a>. The Classic Biome is a small archipelago of islands textured with classic studs. It contains classic trees, rocks, and ores, as well as an NPC that will trade Steel tools for Classic ones (Pickaxe and Axe only).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Important_Locations_and_Quests\">Important Locations and Quests</span></h2>\n<p>The Classic Biome has two notable locations. There is a <a href=\"/wiki/Noob\" title=\"Noob\">noob</a> standing in a fire ring akin to those that appear within Sword Fights on the Heights, and upon interacting with him, you can trade a <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Pickaxe\" title=\"Steel Pickaxe\">Steel Pickaxe</a> for a <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Pickaxe\" title=\"Classic Pickaxe\">Classic Pickaxe</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Axe\" title=\"Steel Axe\">Steel Axe</a> for a <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Axe\" title=\"Classic Axe\">Classic Axe</a>.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> is located at the back of the biome across the red bridge.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lumberwork\">Lumberwork</span></h2>\n<p>Three types of trees spawn in the Classic Biome.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tree\" title=\"Tree\">Classic Trees</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Cactus\" title=\"Classic Cactus\">Classic Cacti</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Purple_Cactus\" title=\"Classic Purple Cactus\">Classic Purple Cacti</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mining\">Mining</span></h2>\n<p>Two types of Stone and two types of Ores spawn in the Classic Biome.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stone\" title=\"Stone\">Classic Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Sand\" title=\"Classic Sand\">Classic Sand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ore\" title=\"Ore\">Classic Ore</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bombastic\" title=\"Bombastic\">\"Bombastic\" Ore</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Classic Biome was made by two members of the Discord server. If you're in the server, you can click <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/1309957319433523270/1328770952523288667\">here</a> to see the announcement - they're credited at the end of the message.</li>\n<li>Interestingly, the Classic Biome is shaped like the <a href=\"/wiki/Linked_Sword\" title=\"Linked Sword\">Linked Sword</a> (note the curved handguard and large pommel), an item bought in the Classic Store. This could possibly link the biome to the <a href=\"/wiki/King_Statues\" title=\"King Statues\">King Statues</a>, who all wield classic-Roblox era swords.<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1c/Classic_biome_outline.png/revision/latest?cb=20250924224257\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Classic Biome, outlined to show it&#39;s sword-like shape\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1c/Classic_biome_outline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250924224257\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"148\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Classic biome outline.png\" data-image-key=\"Classic_biome_outline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Classic_biome_outline.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Classic Biome, outlined to show it's sword-like shape</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav\" title=\"Template:Locations Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Locations_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95%; padding:0; text-align:left; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"background:#372A27; font-size:100%; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations\" title=\"Category:Locations\"><b>Locations</b></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:10%; background:#372A27; color:#FFF; text-align:center; -webkit-border-radius:3px; -moz-border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><small><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Stores\" title=\"Category:Stores\">Stores</a></small>\n</th>\n<td style=\"padding-left:4px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fairway_Island\" title=\"Fairway Island\">Fairway Island</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fungi_Finds\" title=\"Fungi Finds\">Fungi Finds</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/G